OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GAlina Ibragimova, Christian
OL,11,     GPoltera & Cedric Tiberghien play
OL,12,     GRavel & Debussy Piano Trios live
OL,13,     Gat Wigmore Hall, plus Finnish
OL,14,     Gmusic from the Royal Liverpool
OL,15,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod begins a week of
OL,18,     Gprogrammes celebrating pieces
OL,19,     Gwhose authorship has been lost,
OL,20,     Gdeliberately obscured, or never
OL,21,     Grecorded in the first place.
