OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham presents live folk
OL,6,     Gmusic from the John McCusker Trio
OL,7,     Gin Edinburgh, and pianist
OL,8,     GBenjamin Grosvenor also performs
OL,9,     Gin the studio, ahead of playing
OL,10,     Gwith Aurora Orchestra.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Gfavourites.
OL,15,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,16,     GThe BBC Symphony Orchestra,
OL,17,     Gconducted by Sakari Oramo, plays
OL,18,     GBartok's Concerto for Orchestra
OL,19,     Gand Betsy Jolas's Latest. Soloist
OL,20,     GMaria Duenas joins for Korngold's
OL,21,     GViolin Concerto.
