OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 15 JUN
OL,4,G2145FBetween the Ears: Miniatures
OL,5,     F(Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,6,     GA journey to the edge of sleep,
OL,7,     Gwhere consciousness loosens its
OL,8,     Ggrip and the ordinary becomes
OL,9,     Gstrange.
OL,10,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto Kinch is back with an hour
OL,18,     Gof the best in jazz, and South
OL,19,     GAfrican pianist and composer
OL,20,     GNduduzo Makhathini chooses four
OL,21,     Gof his all-time favourite jazz
OL,22,     Grecords.
